  "methodology": "Actual unchanged CodeGen, base CheckRunWork, StartEx/ResumeEx and MigrateOut/In. A nonvirtual call delegates every generated CheckRunWork to the unchanged original implementation, including RESTORE; m_SliceStart is set from original Util.GetTimeStampMS before each source slice. Three bounded resume cycles model scheduler waking after each explicit sleep; no subsequent sleep requests are suppressed. Original generated frame capture and actual StackHibernateException are used. Real minimal Scene resources and original empty async plugins; no backend replacement.",
